# Rust build artifacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Local environment
.env
.env.local

# Aristo runtime artifacts produced by dogfooding the SDK on its own source.
# Downstream projects DO commit these (deterministic + reviewable). This repo
# generates them via `aristo index` / `aristo init` for local validation but
# excludes them from git so the dogfood doesn't churn the tree.
/aristo.toml
# Exclude .aristo/ contents except hand-written feedback artifacts (skill
# PHILOSOPHY.md + per-case audit trail). The `.aristo/index.toml` /
# `.aristo/specs/` / `.aristo/doc/` are regenerated by `aristo stamp`; the
# `.aristo/feedback/` tree is human-curated and tracked.
/.aristo/*
!/.aristo/feedback/
/.github/workflows/aristo.yml
